# make test / make test-full schedule; format and rationale in docs/manifests/checks.md.
# name | tier | lane | needs | inputs | command
#
# Two rows are build steps, not checks: gen-inputs generates the files sim and the nano
# simulators read, once, so that no two rows regenerate them at the same time. sim and nano-sim
# are marked !always because make's own timestamps already decide whether they rebuild.
gen-inputs | fast | - | - | !always | make -s rvfi_macros.vh test/monitor.sim.v
sim | fast | - | gen-inputs | !always
nano-sim | fast | - | gen-inputs | !always
